cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these tools in your work, teaching or a talk, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "SEG-Y Co-render Tools"
abstract: >-
  Two standalone browser tools (simple and advanced) for co-rendering three seismic
  attribute volumes (SEG-Y) as one colour image, using direct RGB, ternary (LAB) or HSV
  blending as in the Ternary Colormap Tool, with inline, crossline and time-slice views.
  The advanced tool adds per-volume histograms and colour maps, a base + overlay mode,
  custom .alut colour maps, per-volume transparency and a 3D view of inline, crossline
  and time-slice panels. Everything runs in the browser; data are never uploaded.
